    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d596">

                <pb facs="0643" n="539" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg539"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 731.51/58.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the American Minister.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-05-21">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 21, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Department has communicated to the French Embassy the substance of your May
                    14. Now that France has a Legation at Caracas, our good offices can scarcely
                    continue beyond the point already reached.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
